% backend: none
% expect-output: 74686520717569636B2062726F776E20666F78>
% expect-output: the quick brown fox
% Scenario: ASCIIHexEncode over standard output writes the hexadecimal
% form of what is written to it, upper case, and closefile ends the data
% with `>` without closing the target; the same text read through
% ASCIIHexDecode gives the bytes back.
% Expect: the hexadecimal text, then the decoded bytes.
(%stdout) (w) file /ASCIIHexEncode filter
dup (the quick brown fox) writestring closefile
(\n) print
(74686520717569636B2062726F776E20666F78>) /ASCIIHexDecode filter
100 string readstring pop =
